test-suites	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-08T02:29:51.7273014Z === issue #2190: the token dies with the container ===
test-suites	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-08T02:29:51.7277176Z   PASS: the watcher waits on the task container itself, not on the solve process
